    "content": "okay so genuine question for the thread: has anyone else had their support ticket get shuffled between like three different teams at NovaMind? \ud83e\udd14 \n\ni submitted something tuesday about a workflow integration issue and it's been ping-ponged back and forth ever since. kills my momentum when i'm in the middle of client work and just need a quick answer, ya know? \n\ncurious if this is just a me thing or if their support structure needs some serious restructuring \ud83d\udc40 #NovaMindAssistant #SupportLife"
  },
  {
